176
00:10:47,220 --> 00:10:47,540
Hey!

177
00:10:47,920 --> 00:10:49,820
You have markings on your face too!

178
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:51,220
Are you sure you're okay?

179
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:53,080
I'm the same person I was.

180
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:55,060
My magic's just been boosted a bit.

181
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,440
All right, fine.

182
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,280
I guess I can spell it out.

183
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,180
How dare you condescend me!

184
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:02,720
I'm royalty after all.

185
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:03,120
Oh yeah?

186
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:05,940
Well, I'm the wind spirit, so you're nothing special, missy.

187
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,160
No one asked you.

188
00:11:07,900 --> 00:11:10,480
The spatial mage who was on standby isn't here.

189
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,920
He must have changed sides like they did.

190
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:13,980
Captain Nozel!

191
00:11:14,620 --> 00:11:15,080
Come in!

192
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:15,940
Can you hear me?

193
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:18,400
What's wrong?

194
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,840
Oh good, you're there.

195
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:21,460
I thought I would never get through.

196
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:22,580
What's that?

197
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:26,040
A magic transmission device that all of the captains have.

198
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:29,260
Several of our squad members have suddenly become violent.

199
00:11:29,660 --> 00:11:31,760
They're acting strange and claiming to be elves.

200
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:36,380
The worst part is, their magic power is much stronger than usual.

201
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:38,100
We can't handle them alone.

202
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:41,680
Apparently, the other squads are experiencing the same thing.

203
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,800
Something must be taking over the kingdom.

204
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:45,680
What was that?

205
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:46,600
Answer me!

206
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:49,320
Is this happening all over the place?

207
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,900
It's not looking good, I know that much.

208
00:11:54,060 --> 00:11:56,240
Come what may, we're still magic knights.

209
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:01,740
Which means our number one responsibility is to protect the Clover Kingdom.

210
00:12:02,100 --> 00:12:05,840
Even if doing so means we have to eliminate some of our own comrades in the process.

211
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,760
And even if it comes at the cost of our lives.

212
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:12,460
But luck...

213
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:16,720
When he attacked me before, his spell didn't hit me.

214
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:23,680
I missed you.

215
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,920
Yeah, looks like I've gotten a little rusty.

216
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,380
Let's try again.

217
00:12:29,060 --> 00:12:31,360
He was moving extremely quickly.

218
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:33,740
But we were still able to get away from him.

219
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:36,260
I think luck made that happen.

220
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,800
Well then, why did he hit me?

221
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,620
I'm sure you deserved it.

222
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:43,800
That means, luck's soul is fighting to resist.

223
00:12:44,220 --> 00:12:45,980
Just like Yuno still has control.

224
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:50,840
And since we know that's possible, we should be able to restore everyone's free will.

225
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:52,280
There has to be a way.

226
00:12:53,020 --> 00:12:56,660
As magic knights, we can save our squad mates and the Clover Kingdom.

227
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:57,900
Yeah.

228
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:00,100
Let's do it.

229
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,120
Alright!

230
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:10,360
Go!

231
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,240
What do you think that is?

232
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:26,180
As soon as those lightswords go away, now this happens?

233
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:28,140
Why is the demon skull glowing?

234
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:29,620
It's frightening.

235
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,520
Hey, see that?

236
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:32,280
Huh?

237
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:34,160
What's happening this time?

238
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,480
It looks like daybreak.

239
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,440
Nuh-uh.

240
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,580
Not that.

241
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,240
Something's coming.

242
00:13:46,240 --> 00:14:10,180
No.

243
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:16,740
It's headed for the capital.

244
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:19,540
But what is it?

245
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,960
Those are my friends, of course.

246
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,460
His friends?

247
00:14:26,940 --> 00:14:29,380
Look at his clothes. He's dressed like her.

248
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:32,200
Your robe tells me you're a magic knight.

249
00:14:33,300 --> 00:14:38,300
It would appear that you humans have rapidly increased in number over the last several centuries.

250
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,060
Sir?

251
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:45,100
The people who possess the least magic power make their homes in this area.

252
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:50,460
And then, as you reach the center, you begin to encounter the stronger inhabitants.

253
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:54,600
I see your kind continues to discriminate in petty ways.

254
00:14:55,780 --> 00:14:58,280
So magic knight? Or not?

255
00:14:58,400 --> 00:14:59,860
Kinda looks like he is.

256
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:03,420
And you weaklings are the target of this prejudice.

257
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:06,740
You humans. So arbitrary.

258
00:15:08,300 --> 00:15:08,620
