259
00:15:09,100 --> 00:15:11,160
Hold on. Who are you exactly?

260
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,280
We do not discriminate.

261
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:15,620
We slaughter all humans.

262
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:18,200
Equally and swiftly.

263
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,500
Poison plant magic.

264
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:23,680
Now, Zoffner's garden of lingering burns.

265
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:32,420
Oh yeah! I'm as good as new!

266
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,660
Hey! Where'd your shirt go?

267
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:37,320
I had to get a good look and make sure my injuries are healed.

268
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:39,980
Okay, now you know, so get dressed already!

269
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:44,280
Now that I've recovered, my beauty can shine to the fullest!

270
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:46,740
I kinda wish you hadn't recovered at all.

271
00:15:48,940 --> 00:15:50,920
The captain should be better too, right?

272
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:53,200
I don't understand why she's not waking up.

273
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,640
Just let her rest.

274
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,120
Oh yeah! You can have this back now!

275
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,520
Throw it out. It only works once.

276
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,620
Whoa, seriously?

277
00:16:00,620 --> 00:16:03,920
I mean, it's kinda cool looking, so I think I'll hang on to it.

278
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,420
Do what you want.

279
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:08,040
We're almost to the Forsaken Realm.

280
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:10,640
What's wrong?

281
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,720
Someone's attacking that area.

282
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:17,300
But that's...

283
00:16:17,300 --> 00:16:17,920
The village!

284
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,820
You know when I grew up there, we have to help!

285
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:21,540
No.

286
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:26,080
We must proceed directly to the capital as quickly as possible.

287
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:30,680
The best way to protect Clover Kingdom is to secure the most populated area first.

288
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:33,260
My hometown is part of this kingdom!

289
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:36,540
You two may do as you see fit, but we press on.

290
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:40,340
That said, you're both crucial to our fighting strength.

291
00:16:40,820 --> 00:16:42,560
Finish quickly and meet us in the capital.

292
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,600
Right!

293
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:45,540
Let me go with them!

294
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,400
You'll remain with us, Noelle.

295
00:16:47,660 --> 00:16:48,780
You're forcing me?

296
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:50,200
You are royalty.

297
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:55,200
I order you to accompany me to safeguard the castle.

298
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,680
You want my help? Really?

299
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:02,440
Although, if we're being honest, your very existence is pointless.

300
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:05,760
This is no place for a pathetic creature like you.

301
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:07,000
Now leave.

302
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:13,720
Right!

303
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:16,840
Then I'll go!

304
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:36,260
I had always found it strange.

305
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,860
Why did I possess poisoned plant magic?

306
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:43,620
It didn't seem logical, but one day I understood.

307
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:47,180
It hurts so much!

308
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,440
Help me!

309
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,580
Please!

310
00:17:49,940 --> 00:17:52,900
It feels like my whole body is being burned alive!

311
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:55,400
That's what this magic is for.

312
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:59,120
Eradicating insignificant lives like yours.

313
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,380
Water creation magic!

314
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:03,540
Holy fist of a lock!

315
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,960
No life is insignificant!

316
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,380
Not one!

317
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:12,500
No, Father!

318
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:14,000
Hang in there!

319
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:17,580
So some of you are able to use a little magic at least.

320
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:19,720
Or is it only you?

321
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,300
Are you of noble blood?

322
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:23,780
Well, no matter.

323
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:27,280
Even the mightiest of humans are powerless against the elves.

324
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:29,060
Who is this guy?

325
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,240
He's a monster!

326
00:18:30,780 --> 00:18:33,400
You're so cruel, hurting a priest like that!

327
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:36,880
Listen, I don't know what happened in your past.

328
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:40,460
But what did the residents of this poor village ever do to you?

329
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:44,080
We live simple, peaceful lives like anyone else!

330
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,200
You'll be okay!

331
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:48,100
I'll make all the alleys disappear!

332
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:49,260
We cry.

333
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:50,020
God!

334
00:18:50,220 --> 00:18:51,540
This is way too confusing!

335
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:52,960
We struggle.

336
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:56,320
At this rate, I don't know how we'll make it through the winter.

337
00:18:56,860 --> 00:18:57,560
We worry.

338
00:18:58,060 --> 00:18:59,100
And yet...

339
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:00,380
Pot potatoes again?

340
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:02,340
At least we have enough food.

341
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:02,760
Yeah!

342
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:04,080
I love pot potatoes!

343
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:07,320
You make the tastiest dishes out of these, sister.

344
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:09,300
I don't mind eating yours, Nash.

345
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:10,000
No way!

346
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:10,740
I still want them!

347
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,520
Food is food!

348
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,060
Need water!

349
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:18,420
We find a way to laugh.

350
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,740
And dream.

351
00:19:20,860 --> 00:19:23,220
And live life with everything we've got!

352
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:25,460
We don't deserve to die like this!

353
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:27,040
Nobody in the kingdom does!

354
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:28,900
Yeah.

355
00:19:30,220 --> 00:19:32,160
You're poor like the rest of us.

356
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,880
Orphaned cast-off.

357
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:36,740
Kids like us don't get to have dreams.

358
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,000
Hey, Nash...

359
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:43,940
No giving up!

360
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,180
You hear me?!

361
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,460
We can dream as much as we want to!

362
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:52,640
Even if you're a poor orphan, you can become great just like anyone else.

363
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:58,500
You can do anything you want, make your dreams come true, and make the people you care about happy!

364
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:01,260
That's exactly what I'm going to prove!

365
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:07,380
If by some chance, some very small one, you actually manage to join the Magic Knights?

366
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:08,320
Yeah, what?

367
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:11,000
Then I'll start believing dreams really can come true!

368
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,120
That I can be anything I want!

369
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:15,980
And maybe one day I'll become a Magic Knight too!

370
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:18,300
Or, you know, whatever.

371
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:25,760
Without me and Yuno here, guess you're going to be the biggest brother from now on!

372
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:27,540
Keep these guys safe!

373
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,180
We're counting on you, Nash!

374
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:33,100
I agree.

375
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,820
No one's life should have to end in sadness.

376
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:39,960
Therefore, I'll wipe out the source of that sadness.

377
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:40,920
Your kind.

378
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:43,500
Poisoned flat magic.

379
00:20:43,820 --> 00:20:45,840
Softness garden of lingering burns.

380
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:46,720
No!

381
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:48,340
Leave her alone!

382
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,240
Stop!

383
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:51,760
Oh no!

384
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:52,620
Stay back!

385
00:20:52,620 --> 00:20:53,280
Ah!

386
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,360
Asta!

387
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:12,560
Yuno!

388
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:14,300
Father, wake up!

389
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,060
It's Asta!

390
00:21:15,220 --> 00:21:15,780
He's back!

391
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:16,840
And Yuno too!

392
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:19,900
You're really brave, Nash.

393
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,020
Good job!

394
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:22,800
You mean it!

395
00:21:23,340 --> 00:21:24,660
Thanks a lot, guys!

396
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:26,160
Stay back!

397
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,600
It's our turn now!

398
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:57,580
We'll be right back!

399
00:21:57,600 --> 00:22:03,160
I don't need no money.

400
00:22:03,820 --> 00:22:06,260
I don't need no魔力は要らない.

401
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:09,220
自力で挑んだミラクル起きること願い.

402
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:12,340
微力ながら1ミリずつビリビリ切り込んでく.

403
00:22:12,540 --> 00:22:13,920
世界を巻き込んでく.

404
00:22:14,140 --> 00:22:16,000
My disabilities, my ability.

405
00:22:16,220 --> 00:22:18,060
逆にそれが俺のエネルギー.

406
00:22:18,720 --> 00:22:26,660
どうしても自らを見失って嫌いになって.

407
00:22:26,660 --> 00:22:30,760
負けそうになったら.

408
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:33,400
Just cry out loud.

409
00:22:34,020 --> 00:22:35,340
傷つく音に.

410
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:37,420
傷つく音に.

411
00:22:38,100 --> 00:22:40,860
立ち向かう勇気へと導いてく.

412
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:41,520
Our treasure.

413
00:22:42,260 --> 00:22:43,380
裏切らないのは.

414
00:22:44,060 --> 00:22:44,740
最高に.

415
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:45,580
There is love.

416
00:22:45,580 --> 00:22:49,740
かざしたちがい光が生きる treasure.

417
00:22:49,740 --> 00:22:59,740
ご視聴ありがとうございました。

